# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client + Server BFF Proxy in SvelteKit)
# Never commit your real .env file or hardcode API keys in source code.
#
# Quickstart with the free zero-billing Maps Demo Key (for prototyping only):
# 1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key
# 5. Copy the key below into your local .env file (cp .env.example .env)
#
# For production, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Street View
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
